<BaseLayout
  title="Are Full Rollouts Necessary for On-Policy Distillation? | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="Controlling the rollout horizon improves the efficiency of on-policy distillation for LLM reasoning, reducing training time by up to 82% without sacrificing performance."
  crumb="Opd Horizon Control"
