<section id="s-results" data-code="results">
<div class="section-no">06 — Results</div>
<h2>POPD and TOPD Deliver Strong Performance with Lower Cost</h2>
<p>
  Experiments on mathematical reasoning datasets (AIME24, AMC23, AIME25) show that POPD improves training efficiency by up to 3×, while TOPD matches standard OPD performance using only 10% of the rollout horizon, reducing training time by up to 82%.
</p>

